        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Clearly Defined, Destination-Focused Experience: We are the only cruise line offering experiences on all seven continents with itineraries across five oceans, 21 rivers and five lakes, and a focus primarily on destinations in Europe and the Mediterranean, rather than the Caribbean.",
        "start_character": 4677,
        "end_character": 4959
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001745201-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001745201-26-000007-5031b027af195bfb",
        "accession_number": "0001745201-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For Asia Outbound, we are offering seven Mediterranean ocean itineraries on board the Viking Yidun in 2026, which is the ship’s first return to Europe after four years sailing exclusively in Asia.",
        "start_character": 16472,
        "end_character": 16668
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001745201-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001745201-26-000007-5031b027af195bfb",
        "accession_number": "0001745201-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the ocean and expedition cruise business, we are subject to regulation by various international, national and local laws, regulations and treaties in force in the jurisdictions in which our ocean and expedition ships will operate.",
        "start_character": 60167,
        "end_character": 60400
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001745201-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001745201-26-000007-5031b027af195bfb",
        "accession_number": "0001745201-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are registered as a seller of travel under the California Business and Professions Code, and we participate in the California Travel Consumer Restitution Fund, which provides refunds to guests who are unable to collect from their respective seller of travel, by making annual assessments into the fund.",
        "start_character": 65282,
        "end_character": 65587
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001745201-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001745201-26-000007-5031b027af195bfb",
        "accession_number": "0001745201-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We do not sell any of our products through wholesalers.",
        "start_character": 57176,
        "end_character": 57231
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001745201-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001745201-26-000007-5031b027af195bfb",
        "accession_number": "0001745201-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have preferred relationships with large travel agent consortia, and we employ sales managers in key markets to maximize awareness of our products within the travel agent community.",
        "start_character": 56353,
        "end_character": 56536
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001745201-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001745201-26-000007-5031b027af195bfb",
        "accession_number": "0001745201-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We leveraged our experience in destination-focused travel and innovative ship design to reimagine the expedition voyage, delivering a unique product that offers our core demographic the opportunity to visit some of the most remote regions of the world such as the Arctic and Antarctica, as well as destinations closer to home for our large North American customer base, including the Great Lakes and Canada.",
        "start_character": 12231,
        "end_character": 12638
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001745201-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001745201-26-000007-5031b027af195bfb",
        "accession_number": "0001745201-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For the 2025 season, we began selling select itineraries more than two years prior to the start of the season.",
        "start_character": 26564,
        "end_character": 26674
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001745201-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001745201-26-000007-5031b027af195bfb",
        "accession_number": "0001745201-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "From the outset, we have designed all of our ships thoughtfully to reduce their fuel consumption, carbon footprint and overall environmental impact.",
        "start_character": 30801,
        "end_character": 30949
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001745201-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001745201-26-000007-5031b027af195bfb",
        "accession_number": "0001745201-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, as we market and sell cruises that embark guests at U.S.",
        "start_character": 61549,
        "end_character": 61618
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001745201-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001745201-26-000007-5031b027af195bfb",
        "accession_number": "0001745201-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The vessels we operate under the Viking River Cruise brand are registered in Egypt, Portugal, Russia, Switzerland, Ukraine and Vietnam.",
        "start_character": 59623,
        "end_character": 59758
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001745201-26-000007",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001745201-26-000007-5031b027af195bfb",
        "accession_number": "0001745201-26-000007",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-03",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are conscious of our responsibility with respect to the environmental and social impact of our operations, and have assumed such responsibility through the environmental considerations apparent in the design of our fleet, our scientific research partnerships, our cultural partnerships, investments in the community and the investments we make in our workforce.",
